Package: regextable
Title: Pattern-Based Text Extraction and Standardization Using Lookup Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Shirlyn", "Dong", email = "shirlynd@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extract structured data from text using lookup tables of regular 
    expressions. Features an optimized "shrinking pool" algorithm to efficiently 
    match thousands of patterns against large text datasets. Useful for normalizing 
    entities (like names, companies, or organizations) and standardizing 
    unstructured text.
